msgid "How many logos can I add?"
msgstr ""

#: ../includes/welcome/view.php:44
msgid "GS Logo Slider's Pro version allows you to add unlimited logos. In the free version, up to 20 logos can be presented at once. You can add as many logos as necessary and sort them into categories. The number of logos on your page will not have an impact on your page loading speed."
